WEBVTT

00:01.430 --> 00:06.360
<b>This one is an outstanding swordsman
even among our experts.</b>

00:06.900 --> 00:09.860
<b>His price is quite high. Can you pay it?</b>

00:10.610 --> 00:11.860
<b>Hmph!</b>

00:16.030 --> 00:18.450
<b>This is smallpox virus.</b>

00:20.160 --> 00:21.410
<b><i>Smallpox.</i></b>

00:22.410 --> 00:25.290
<b><i>In Japanese, it is known
as ten'nento, hoso, and toso.</i></b>

00:25.290 --> 00:29.300
<b><i>It is an infectious disease
caused by the smallpox virus.</i></b>

00:30.340 --> 00:37.260
<b><i>It is very infectious among humans
and was feared as a lethal disease.</i></b>

00:38.550 --> 00:41.850
<b>If I spread this in the streets
and create patients,</b>

00:41.850 --> 00:44.440
<b>I can make as much money as I want.</b>

00:44.940 --> 00:48.940
<b>No matter how high his price is,
there are no problems whatsoever.</b>

00:50.070 --> 00:51.570
<b>Well, all right.</b>

00:51.570 --> 00:53.860
<b>Hate to say this after all that, but...</b>

00:54.650 --> 00:57.200
<b>it's a part of my job to be well aware</b>

00:57.200 --> 01:00.120
<b>that low-quality medicine
is completely useless.</b>

01:00.580 --> 01:02.910
<b>The same can be said for bodyguards.</b>

01:05.080 --> 01:10.040
<b>I'm going to spend a large sum of money.
I would like to check his qualities.</b>

01:10.420 --> 01:14.630
<b>Hmph. All that will do
is make your bodyguard useless.</b>

01:17.840 --> 01:18.800
<b>Oh?</b>

01:20.760 --> 01:23.640
<b>That sword has quite a unique shape.</b>

01:25.020 --> 01:26.690
<b>Look here!</b>

01:27.390 --> 01:31.400
<b>You think you can win
against my metal club</b>

01:31.400 --> 01:32.940
<b>with such a wispy little stick?</b>

01:33.690 --> 01:35.610
<b>I'll teach you a lesson!</b>

01:40.160 --> 01:41.370
<b>Oh!</b>

01:43.370 --> 01:44.790
<b>What the hell just happened?</b>

01:46.290 --> 01:52.040
<b>Eastern katana or Western sword,
which is stronger?</b>

01:52.500 --> 01:55.970
<b>Time for a showdown, Hitokiri Battosai!</b>

03:26.970 --> 03:30.980
<b>EPISODE 21:
MEIJI SWORDSMAN
ROMANTIC STORY,
ACT ZERO
PART TWO</b>

03:31.810 --> 03:33.190
<b>In any case...</b>

03:33.400 --> 03:38.150
<b>I was surprised that you were a lady
in a man's clothing, that I was.</b>

03:38.730 --> 03:41.360
<b>This isn't just limited to doctors.</b>

03:41.860 --> 03:44.200
<b>In the world
of male-dominated occupations,</b>

03:44.200 --> 03:48.660
<b>women are almost never trusted,
regardless of how skilled they are.</b>

03:49.660 --> 03:55.420
<b>In reality, nurses and helpers
are trusted a lot more in my case.</b>

03:55.630 --> 03:57.880
<b>Even in the West, that is?</b>

03:57.880 --> 03:58.750
<b>Yes.</b>

03:59.340 --> 04:03.090
<b>That is why I decided to wear
platform shoes and a derby hat,</b>

04:03.590 --> 04:07.760
<b>fabricate a voice and mannerisms,
and put a mask over my face.</b>

04:07.970 --> 04:11.180
<b>I was surprised at your change in guise,</b>

04:11.180 --> 04:13.600
<b>but a voice isn't something
that can easily change.</b>

04:14.230 --> 04:16.940
<b>You must have done
quite a bit of training, that you did.</b>

04:16.940 --> 04:19.480
<b>I've always been good at stuff like this.</b>

04:19.480 --> 04:22.700
<b>Back in my homeland,
I often did one-man shows.</b>

04:23.150 --> 04:24.530
<b>O Romeo...</b>

04:25.030 --> 04:26.120
<b>Juliet!</b>

04:26.660 --> 04:28.830
<b>Wherefore art thou Romeo?</b>

04:28.830 --> 04:30.160
<b>Whoa!</b>

04:33.370 --> 04:34.750
<b>But still...</b>

04:36.000 --> 04:36.960
<b><i>A mask?</i></b>

04:36.960 --> 04:38.250
<b><i>Mysterious.</i></b>

04:38.590 --> 04:40.090
<b><i>Is he really a doctor?</i></b>

04:40.090 --> 04:42.260
<b><i>Better to stay out of this.</i></b>

04:43.130 --> 04:45.180
<b>This is a tale of hardship, that it is.</b>

04:45.760 --> 04:48.010
<b>Now that you are dressing like a man,</b>

04:48.010 --> 04:50.260
<b>you end up being treated
as some mysterious person.</b>

04:50.720 --> 04:51.640
<b>It's fine.</b>

04:52.140 --> 04:54.310
<b>This is how I chose to live my life.</b>

04:56.560 --> 05:01.900
<b>If there is a world behind this mask
where everyone can live in good health...</b>

05:03.320 --> 05:05.490
<b>Oh, that sounds a bit too grandiose.</b>

05:06.360 --> 05:07.280
<b>No.</b>

05:08.490 --> 05:10.370
<b>That was unnecessary scrutiny,
that it was.</b>

05:10.780 --> 05:13.250
<b>I will take my leave now, that I will.</b>

05:13.540 --> 05:14.370
<b>Huh?</b>

05:14.370 --> 05:17.960
<b>I can't possibly stay here now that
I know you are a lady, that I can't.</b>

05:19.590 --> 05:20.420
<b>Miss Elder.</b>

05:20.880 --> 05:21.880
<b>Yes?</b>

05:22.210 --> 05:26.220
<b>Mr. Dankichi has quite a bit
of trust in you.</b>

05:26.470 --> 05:30.550
<b>And that mother and child is sure to be
happy about what you did, that they will.</b>

05:32.140 --> 05:36.640
<b>The way you chose to live is most likely
not a mistake, that it isn't.</b>

05:37.600 --> 05:38.480
<b>See you.</b>

05:48.200 --> 05:52.330
<b><i>Hiten Mitsurugi-ryu,
I had heard about it before...</i></b>

05:54.410 --> 05:57.000
<b><i>but I didn't think it actually existed.</i></b>

05:58.460 --> 06:01.920
<b><i>Have you ever slain men
with this Hiten Mitsurugi-ryu?</i></b>

06:02.420 --> 06:03.300
<b><i>No.</i></b>

06:03.710 --> 06:07.050
<b><i>Then, do you think you can slay men?</i></b>

06:10.890 --> 06:15.600
<b><i>If there is a new era
where everyone can live at ease...</i></b>

06:16.350 --> 06:19.730
<b><i>beyond my bloodstained blade
and the lives of the victims...</i></b>

06:21.810 --> 06:27.150
<b><i>If there is a world behind this mask
where everyone can live in good health...</i></b>

06:35.910 --> 06:36.750
<b>Oro?</b>

06:40.500 --> 06:42.840
<b>Doc! Dr. Elder!</b>

06:43.840 --> 06:46.420
<b>What is exactly the matter, Mr. Dankichi?</b>

06:46.800 --> 06:50.510
<b>Huh? I heard that you
already received the message.</b>

06:50.970 --> 06:53.260
<b>Oh, well. Please come with me.</b>

06:54.680 --> 06:55.850
<b>An emergency call?</b>

06:55.850 --> 07:00.060
<b>No. They specified the time, so I
don't think this is an emergency call.</b>

07:00.190 --> 07:04.270
<b>Specified the time? In the darkest
of the night, right before dawn?</b>

07:06.860 --> 07:08.150
<b>This is strange.</b>

07:08.150 --> 07:09.280
<b>This is strange.</b>

07:09.490 --> 07:11.950
<b>Wait! There's someone
in the middle of the road!</b>

07:12.070 --> 07:13.700
<b>Look out! Out of the way!</b>

07:20.330 --> 07:21.540
<b>The hell is that?</b>

07:21.920 --> 07:23.250
<b>What's he up to?</b>

07:23.250 --> 07:24.670
<b>Out of the way!</b>

07:24.920 --> 07:28.130
<b><i>Destornillador Sable Estillo...</i></b>

07:28.380 --> 07:31.050
<b><i>Tormenta Infierno!</i></b>

07:39.390 --> 07:43.230
<b>We didn't have to come out here to watch.
That guy is amazing!</b>

07:43.230 --> 07:46.190
<b>It's important that I witness it
with my own eyes.</b>

07:46.440 --> 07:49.150
<b>I don't trust anyone in this world.</b>

07:49.400 --> 07:50.860
<b>Not even you.</b>

07:51.360 --> 07:52.240
<b>Huh?</b>

07:52.490 --> 07:54.660
<b>Twisting his body to the limit</b>

07:54.660 --> 07:59.410
<b>and using the resulting spinning force
to gain maximum power...</b>

07:59.870 --> 08:03.830
<b>that is what
Destornillador Sable Estillo is about.</b>

08:05.170 --> 08:06.000
<b>Doc!</b>

08:06.210 --> 08:07.960
<b>Where is the samurai?</b>

08:08.130 --> 08:08.960
<b>Huh?</b>

08:08.960 --> 08:11.220
<b>That man with the cross-shaped scar.</b>

08:11.300 --> 08:12.550
<b>Let go of that hand.</b>

08:16.180 --> 08:19.680
<b>I forgot to hand Mr. Elder
this message earlier.</b>

08:19.810 --> 08:22.940
<b>It took a bit of effort to have it
translated into Japanese at the hotel.</b>

08:23.270 --> 08:25.730
<b>But it was a message
to lure Mr. Elder out.</b>

08:26.610 --> 08:28.730
<b>Mr. Rurouni...</b>

08:29.440 --> 08:31.440
<b>A cross-shaped scar indeed.</b>

08:31.440 --> 08:33.200
<b>A samurai indeed.</b>

08:34.660 --> 08:39.740
<b>As men who have truly mastered
swordsmanship, I challenge you to a duel.</b>

08:40.240 --> 08:44.500
<b>I want to know who is
the superior swordsman.</b>

08:44.710 --> 08:47.710
<b>The legendary man said to be
the strongest man ever!</b>

08:48.040 --> 08:49.710
<b>Hitokiri Battosai!</b>

08:52.300 --> 08:55.800
<b>Murdering many a leading figure
as an assassin</b>

08:55.800 --> 09:00.390
<b>and fighting multiple veterans in the
Bakumatsu Era as a mercenary swordsman!</b>

09:01.020 --> 09:05.600
<b>You are without a doubt one of
the strongest samurai, Hitokiri Battosai!</b>

09:07.020 --> 09:09.520
<b>I did away with that name
10 years ago, that I did.</b>

09:09.520 --> 09:11.070
<b>How absurd!</b>

09:11.070 --> 09:14.700
<b>You did away with your name?
Then what is that katana on your waist?</b>

09:15.070 --> 09:16.450
<b>Now draw it!</b>

09:16.450 --> 09:18.660
<b>Draw it, and fight me!</b>

09:33.920 --> 09:37.430
<b>If you wish it that badly,
I have no other choice.</b>

09:42.140 --> 09:44.640
<b>Apologies for the rough handling.</b>

09:49.900 --> 09:52.400
<b>I hear that a katana
is the soul of a samurai.</b>

09:57.860 --> 10:00.570
<b>Now unleash that soul of yours!</b>

10:00.910 --> 10:03.990
<b>Before the days of the sword
becomes completely extinct!</b>

10:04.330 --> 10:06.960
<b><i>Tormenta Infierno!</i></b>

10:08.830 --> 10:09.670
<b>That thrust!</b>

10:11.590 --> 10:13.090
<b>Don't take the blow!</b>

10:13.090 --> 10:14.800
<b>You'll spin around and get blown away!</b>

10:22.640 --> 10:25.390
<b><i>Tempestar Infierno!</i></b>

10:39.990 --> 10:41.070
<b>Hmph.</b>

10:41.280 --> 10:45.370
<b>That saber was altered for toughness,</b>

10:45.370 --> 10:49.250
<b>and Espiral trained his body
to physically altered levels,</b>

10:49.250 --> 10:52.590
<b>but every technique unleashed was dodged
perfectly within a paper-thin margin.</b>

10:52.920 --> 10:55.460
<b>I'd expect nothing less
from the legendary manslayer.</b>

11:00.430 --> 11:05.470
<b>It seems we'll see the ultimate
Destornillador Sable Estillo technique</b>

11:05.470 --> 11:07.100
<b>for the first time in a while.</b>

11:08.810 --> 11:12.150
<b>What the hell is that?
His body is completely twisted!</b>

11:13.270 --> 11:17.230
<b>We are the final samurai
and the final swordsman.</b>

11:17.690 --> 11:20.700
<b>Who will be the last one standing?</b>

11:20.950 --> 11:23.200
<b>Let us decide now!</b>

11:26.990 --> 11:30.000
<b>RUROUNI KENSHIN</b>

11:31.960 --> 11:35.960
<b>We are the final samurai
and the final swordsman.</b>

11:36.460 --> 11:39.170
<b>Who will be the last one standing?</b>

11:39.670 --> 11:41.680
<b>Let us decide now!</b>

11:41.880 --> 11:45.350
<b>Take this! My strongest,
fastest, ultimate attack!</b>

11:45.970 --> 11:48.850
<b><i>Tornado Infierno!</i></b>

11:53.900 --> 11:54.730
<b>Mr. Rurouni!</b>

12:07.200 --> 12:08.040
<b>He did it!</b>

12:11.410 --> 12:12.960
<b>Oh, my.</b>

12:12.960 --> 12:15.000
<b>He took the force
of Espiral's ultimate attack</b>

12:15.000 --> 12:18.380
<b>and added it to his own slashing attack
to slam it back.</b>

12:27.260 --> 12:30.270
<b>The last one standing is the samurai.</b>

12:31.270 --> 12:34.140
<b>Ah, well, if someone of your caliber</b>

12:34.140 --> 12:37.190
<b>is going to slay me,
I couldn't wish for more.</b>

12:38.190 --> 12:40.400
<b>Now give me the final blow.</b>

12:41.190 --> 12:42.700
<b>How scandalous.</b>

12:42.900 --> 12:44.450
<b>Look closely, that you should.</b>

12:45.410 --> 12:47.660
<b>This is my current katana.</b>

12:48.120 --> 12:49.790
<b>Sakabato?</b>

12:50.830 --> 12:55.750
<b>My Hiten Mitsurugi-ryu is a murderous
sword that most certainly butchers men.</b>

12:56.330 --> 13:00.710
<b>That is, unless I use this creative katana
to prevent me from murdering them.</b>

13:04.470 --> 13:07.470
<b>A katana is a samurai's soul.</b>

13:07.970 --> 13:08.930
<b>I see.</b>

13:09.430 --> 13:12.060
<b>So that is your current soul.</b>

13:13.810 --> 13:15.810
<b>A different caliber,
in both skill and class!</b>

13:16.060 --> 13:18.770
<b>Damn it! Then at least—</b>

13:24.950 --> 13:26.200
<b>"Smallpox"!</b>

13:26.320 --> 13:27.160
<b>Whoa!</b>

13:27.160 --> 13:29.490
<b>That's smallpox virus!
It's very dangerous!</b>

13:38.420 --> 13:39.630
<b>O smallpox!</b>

13:39.840 --> 13:42.420
<b>Ride the wind,
and spread all over Yokohama!</b>

13:42.420 --> 13:45.260
<b>And amid all of the confusion,
I will make a run for it!</b>

13:59.100 --> 14:00.860
<b>The score has been settled.</b>

14:00.860 --> 14:03.030
<b>Don't further tarnish my defeat.</b>

14:05.690 --> 14:07.110
<b>Ishizu, damn you!</b>

14:12.740 --> 14:15.450
<b>I am satisfied with being able
to witness a great fight.</b>

14:15.450 --> 14:16.830
<b>I surrender.</b>

14:38.640 --> 14:40.810
<b>You saved me?</b>

14:41.310 --> 14:44.440
<b>All injured and sick
are equal as my patients.</b>

14:44.940 --> 14:46.240
<b>Is that so?</b>

14:46.240 --> 14:47.070
<b>Yes.</b>

14:48.530 --> 14:50.780
<b>In an era where swords are going extinct,</b>

14:50.780 --> 14:53.660
<b>I sought to be the strongest
at the sword.</b>

14:54.200 --> 14:55.040
<b>However...</b>

14:55.240 --> 14:59.370
<b>even that was smashed
in front of an Eastern samurai.</b>

15:00.120 --> 15:04.170
<b>I have no reason to live,
even if my wounds were to heal.</b>

15:06.550 --> 15:08.590
<b>Seeking to be the best</b>

15:08.590 --> 15:11.430
<b>despite being in an era where
swordsmanship is meeting its end...</b>

15:12.140 --> 15:14.310
<b>I believe that is something
to be proud of.</b>

15:15.180 --> 15:20.390
<b>However, when your goals are too large,
you tend to get lost.</b>

15:22.980 --> 15:27.860
<b>Nobody would ever carry a map of Japan
just to tour Yokohama, would they?</b>

15:28.440 --> 15:31.820
<b>I have gotten lost along the way?</b>

15:35.490 --> 15:38.580
<b>Indeed, that may be the case.</b>

15:41.460 --> 15:43.170
<b>Ishizu has been arrested,</b>

15:43.170 --> 15:45.920
<b>and the middleman
has been deported, that is.</b>

15:46.460 --> 15:48.260
<b>Then we have peace of mind.</b>

15:49.170 --> 15:53.390
<b>From my eyes, this is far
from peace of mind, that it is.</b>

15:54.260 --> 15:57.640
<b>It was an honor to fight you, Battosai.</b>

15:58.140 --> 16:01.850
<b>No, you said you had already
rid yourself of that name.</b>

16:02.270 --> 16:03.810
<b>I am a rurouni.</b>

16:04.310 --> 16:05.940
<b>I am a traveling swordsman, that I am.</b>

16:06.400 --> 16:07.980
<b>I am Espiral.</b>

16:08.480 --> 16:11.570
<b>I felt despair at the closure
of the era of swords.</b>

16:12.110 --> 16:15.620
<b>However, I realized when Dr. Elder told me</b>

16:15.870 --> 16:18.290
<b>that I would get lost using a map
that was too broad...</b>

16:19.500 --> 16:23.420
<b>it's not bad to live with smaller hopes,</b>

16:23.420 --> 16:27.290
<b>instead of despairing
over something as large as an era.</b>

16:27.960 --> 16:29.840
<b>Smaller hopes?</b>

16:30.590 --> 16:36.300
<b>As long as I continue to be a swordsman,
the era of swords does not end for me.</b>

16:36.970 --> 16:38.430
<b>That's how I decided to think.</b>

16:39.220 --> 16:40.270
<b>And so...</b>

16:42.310 --> 16:43.600
<b>That sword...</b>

16:44.100 --> 16:48.070
<b>Just like how you switched to a sakabato
from a man-slaying katana,</b>

16:48.440 --> 16:51.740
<b>I swapped out my twisted blade
for a straight one.</b>

16:51.740 --> 16:54.780
<b>I chose to become a swordsman
to protect Dr. Elder.</b>

16:55.530 --> 16:58.410
<b>Though I will be all right on my own.</b>

16:58.620 --> 17:02.870
<b>At the least, let me accompany you to your
next port of call in the United States.</b>

17:03.370 --> 17:05.000
<b>I gave in to his persistence.</b>

17:05.000 --> 17:06.330
<b>I see.</b>

17:06.330 --> 17:09.300
<b>Yesterday's foe
is today's ally, that it is.</b>

17:09.800 --> 17:10.630
<b>Yes.</b>

17:11.840 --> 17:15.590
<b>Mr. Elder, you and Mr. Espiral
will be leaving the country now?</b>

17:16.090 --> 17:17.600
<b>- Yes.
- Yeah.</b>

17:18.050 --> 17:19.050
<b>Fare you well.</b>

17:30.110 --> 17:32.070
<b>I will go through
the embarking procedures.</b>

17:33.190 --> 17:35.400
<b>I'm happy that you will see us off.</b>

17:35.400 --> 17:36.950
<b>When someone sees me off,</b>

17:36.950 --> 17:40.700
<b>I feel like they will welcome me back
the next time I drop by.</b>

17:41.040 --> 17:42.910
<b>It wasn't just me, that it wasn't.</b>

17:43.120 --> 17:44.370
<b>Huh?</b>

17:44.370 --> 17:46.960
<b>Doc! Dr. Elder!</b>

17:47.250 --> 17:49.210
<b>I heard it from Dankichi!</b>

17:49.210 --> 17:52.340
<b>You protected the settlement
from that scum, Deian?</b>

17:52.840 --> 17:54.300
<b>Come by again!</b>

17:54.510 --> 17:56.760
<b>My mom is all better now!</b>

17:56.970 --> 17:58.180
<b>Thanks!</b>

17:58.180 --> 17:59.850
<b>Thank you very much!</b>

17:59.850 --> 18:02.810
<b>You'll have a lot of people
welcoming you next time, that you will.</b>

18:03.390 --> 18:04.730
<b>Thank you so much!</b>

18:05.600 --> 18:07.730
<b>Everyone, please stay healthy!</b>

18:07.940 --> 18:09.860
<b>Whoa! What a hot lady!</b>

18:11.860 --> 18:14.320
<b>Fare you well. Please be of help</b>

18:14.320 --> 18:18.110
<b>to those who are ailing from injury
or illness, that you should.</b>

18:18.610 --> 18:20.620
<b>Yes. I will do my best</b>

18:20.620 --> 18:23.830
<b>so that as many people as possible
can live in good health.</b>

18:29.080 --> 18:30.460
<b>Such a large scar.</b>

18:30.960 --> 18:33.300
<b>It seems like an old sword cut,</b>

18:33.800 --> 18:36.590
<b>but it somehow looks
like it was created recently.</b>

18:37.420 --> 18:39.760
<b>Your mind and your body are connected</b>

18:39.760 --> 18:42.760
<b>far more deeply and powerfully
than you can imagine.</b>

18:43.890 --> 18:46.770
<b>I don't know what happened in your past.</b>

18:47.270 --> 18:50.150
<b>But if that past is linked to that scar...</b>

18:50.730 --> 18:55.360
<b>how about you move to a new land
and start living a completely new life?</b>

18:56.320 --> 18:58.110
<b>It's called change-of-air therapy.</b>

18:58.110 --> 19:00.070
<b>Leaving an area
that you're used to living in</b>

19:00.200 --> 19:02.320
<b>and putting yourself
in a different environment</b>

19:02.320 --> 19:04.330
<b>will bring you peace of mind and healing.</b>

19:06.200 --> 19:07.910
<b>I appreciate your attentiveness.</b>

19:08.790 --> 19:12.330
<b>However, my past
is something I chose for myself.</b>

19:13.250 --> 19:15.670
<b>I can't just let it go, that I can't.</b>

19:16.300 --> 19:19.510
<b>I will keep both the past
and the scar as is.</b>

19:21.090 --> 19:22.890
<b>And at the very least, with this sword...</b>

19:23.850 --> 19:28.350
<b>I will protect as many people
that catch my eye as I can, that I will.</b>

19:30.190 --> 19:31.940
<b>Indeed so.</b>

19:31.940 --> 19:34.480
<b>If a katana is a samurai's soul,</b>

19:34.480 --> 19:40.280
<b>for you, wielding that no-kill katana,
that way of life is likely the best fit.</b>

21:13.120 --> 21:15.080
<b>And that was how the story went,
that it was.</b>

21:15.580 --> 21:19.460
<b>Hey, Kenshin,
just how long ago did that story happen?</b>

21:19.670 --> 21:21.090
<b>Let's see.</b>

21:21.090 --> 21:22.510
<b>I think it was about five days</b>

21:22.510 --> 21:25.050
<b>before I started living
at Kamiya Dojo, that it was.</b>

21:25.340 --> 21:26.260
<b>Five days?</b>

21:26.430 --> 21:28.850
<b>So this story was that recent, huh?</b>

21:29.180 --> 21:32.220
<b>I totally thought it was
a story from way in the past.</b>

21:33.140 --> 21:36.770
<b>I didn't say I was going
to tell you an old tale, that I didn't.</b>

21:36.770 --> 21:37.940
<b>Well, that's true.</b>

21:38.650 --> 21:41.280
<b>But if so,
there is something that bothers me.</b>

21:41.400 --> 21:42.230
<b>Oro?</b>

21:42.440 --> 21:43.610
<b>If you excuse me...</b>

21:48.240 --> 21:49.490
<b>Ken-san, you know...</b>

21:49.910 --> 21:52.410
<b>you said that you could smell
the daphnes in the garden,</b>

21:52.410 --> 21:55.160
<b>but you couldn't smell the black tea.</b>

21:55.920 --> 21:57.790
<b>That is correct, that it is.</b>

21:57.790 --> 22:02.050
<b>But, Kenshin, you said right now
that this tea was really tasty.</b>

22:03.840 --> 22:05.170
<b>Oh, that's right.</b>

22:05.670 --> 22:06.880
<b>Then you're fine.</b>

22:10.180 --> 22:13.720
<b>One last piece of advice as a doctor.</b>

22:14.890 --> 22:19.650
<b>No matter what the injury or illness,
you need rest on top of treatment.</b>

22:20.310 --> 22:22.610
<b>It is important to settle down
in one location</b>

22:22.610 --> 22:25.400
<b>and soothe your mind and body over time.</b>

22:26.400 --> 22:30.780
<b>If, in the future, you ever come across
someone that calls for you...</b>

22:31.280 --> 22:35.290
<b>please do try
and pause your journey at that time.</b>

22:38.250 --> 22:39.250
<b>All right.</b>

22:40.330 --> 22:42.500
<b>I will keep that in mind, that I will.</b>

22:45.010 --> 22:50.010
<b>NEXT EPISODE
RESURRECTION OF THE WOLF</b>

22:46.220 --> 22:49.010
<b><i>Next episode, "Resurrection of the Wolf."</i></b>
